    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358">

                <pb facs="0693" n="633" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg633"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Señor Romero to Mr.
                        Hunter,.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 16, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Romero presents his respects to Mr. William Hunter, and has the honor to
                    remit to him copy of a telegram sent yesterday by the consul of the Mexican
                    republic at New Orleans to the Mexican consul at New York, respecting an
                    expedition which is said to be in preparation at that port to land in
                    Mexico.</p>
                <p>Mr. Romero begs that Mr. Hunter will please do what is needful, in case such
                    expedition is really contemplated, to prevent it from taking place.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Hunter</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;C., &amp;C., &amp;C<hi rendition="#italic">.</hi></hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d358-a1.xml" xpointer="d358-a1"/>
            </div>
